<div class="fade-up">
  <div class="page-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Integrasi</p>
      <h1>Kunci API</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Kunci ini dipakai website atau aplikasi kamu untuk membuat tagihan otomatis. Jaga kerahasiaannya, jangan dibagikan ke siapa pun.</p>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="open-create">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
      Buat Kunci Baru
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-warning mb-16">
    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg>
    <span>Kunci hanya ditampilkan <strong>sekali</strong> saat dibuat. Setelah ditutup, kunci tidak bisa dilihat lagi — jadi salin dulu sebelum keluar.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table class="table">
        <thead><tr><th>Nama</th><th>Awalan kunci</th><th>Terakhir dipakai</th><th>Dibuat</th><th>Status</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="keyRows"><tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center muted">Memuat…</td></tr></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Create modal -->
<dialog class="modal" id="createModal" aria-labelledby="createModalTitle">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h3 id="createModalTitle">Buat Kunci API Baru</h3>
      <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Tutup dialog" type="button" data-action="close-modal" data-modal="createModal">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="keyName">Nama kunci</label>
        <input class="input" id="keyName" maxlength="60" required autofocus placeholder="Bot production">
      </div>
      <div id="newKeyBox" class="hidden">
        <hr class="divider">
        <div class="alert alert-success">Kunci berhasil dibuat. <strong>Salin sekarang</strong> — tidak akan ditampilkan lagi.</div>
        <div class="field">
          <div class="small mb-8">Kunci API</div>
          <div class="key-box">
            <span id="newKeyValue"></span>
            <button data-action="copy" data-target="newKeyValue" aria-label="Salin kunci API">Salin</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="keyError" class="alert alert-error hidden" role="alert"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-action="close-modal" data-modal="createModal">Tutup</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btnGen" data-action="create-key">Buat Kunci</button>
    </div>
</dialog>
